# backend_parity.py output. Regenerated by every run, so a committed copy would go stale and
# then read as the record. The record is the CHANGELOG entry and the session closeout.
windows-converter/backend_parity.json
# Probe page renders: ~1 MB each and byte-reproducible from the source PDF at the dpi the
# probe README records. The model's OUTPUTS (glm-*.md) are the evidence and stay tracked.
prototypes/glm-ocr-probe/*.png

# S78: the glass detector's own bytecode
observability/__pycache__/
prototypes/__pycache__/
prototypes/**/__pycache__/

# --- Wiki profiles: the private layer (S107) ---
# The repo is PUBLIC on GitHub. A profile's personal content lives only in the
# gitignored *.private.md layer; the tracked layer carries role + working agreements.
# Enforced mechanically by `.claude/skills/wiki/wiki.sh check` (a tracked private
# file is a measured red).
wiki/profiles/*.private.md
